      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -100
      ],
      "notes": "Acceptance 9: a Vietnamese source makes no call to the translate service at all. Whisper's detected language is the only input to this decision, which is why /transcribe returns it."
    },
    {
